Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你们告诉我...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果力量并非一切 我又该相信什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:17.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝·暗塌谷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:21.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,直到最后 你都是一个愚蠢的学生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:25.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝 坚持住！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:27.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该已经消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}Cure Sky与最强的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为... 为什么... 一人之下...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:19.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly 麻烦你为女帝治疗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:21.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,劝你别这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:26.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,对诞生自暗塌谷能量之海的人而言
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:28.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,光明的力量是毒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那... 那要怎么办...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:34.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,被光明的力量迷惑 放弃了暗塌谷能量...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:39.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃了这最强的力量 自作自受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.65,0:02:43.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,父女都落得一个相同的下场啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:48.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,和皇帝相同？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:03:00.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你想起被封印的记忆了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天泪公主会喜欢这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.71,0:03:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 和平这东西也挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来的女帝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“力量既一切” 这是暗塌谷帝国一直以来的信念
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该去寻找 支持我们生存下去的新的信念了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这将会是一条荆棘路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想必我们会在途中迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:47.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要坚持 终有一日可以...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（冲击声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这记忆是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:06.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是真正的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:07.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:12.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 杀害了皇帝·暗塌谷的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:20.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,将虚假的记忆植入女帝脑中的人也是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:23.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,“Cure Noble背叛了我们"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:27.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝坚信着我编写的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为... 为什么要做这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,为了将你的灵魂与肉体...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:37.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,将你的一切都献给暗塌谷能量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:42.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量啊 必需要有使用者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:46.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,有了渴望力量 一心破坏的使用者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:48.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量才得以称之为力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:53.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量需要容器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:57.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是不能强硬地夺取肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:05:01.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只是这样就无法发挥出100%的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟是什么人...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:11.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我已不再是一人之下 我是暗塌谷能量的化身...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗黑首领
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:25.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要击退他！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:27.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:28.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:34.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,夹击他！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:42.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,休想...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:44.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:49.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:00.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放任Cure Majesty降临
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:03.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,与Precure们的战斗连战连败
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:06.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一切的努力都被你浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:11.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 说起来 还有一件谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:14.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我有说过“我所爱的”吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谎言中的谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所相信的事物...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所相信的一切都是谎言...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:36.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胸口好痛... 不能呼吸...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其留下这种记忆 干脆消失掉算了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:45.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,放了女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:50.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快放了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:51.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,为何？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:57.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们忘了这女人... 暗塌谷帝国对你们的所作所为了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:07.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该没有这么做的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:13.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对正在哭泣的人伸出援手 不需要理由
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:19.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 找到了好容器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:22.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:29.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,想要夺回这女人的话 就跟过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:31.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来暗塌谷帝国
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:35.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,是通向暗塌谷帝国的通道！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:39.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,明显是陷阱 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧！去救女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:43.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,都不用疑问！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.83,0:07:44.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:50.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须要回答女帝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:59.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,力量并非一切的话 应该相信什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:02.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,回答她的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到暗塌谷帝国
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,...没人欢迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:27.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那边！乱暴兽们在守护那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:29.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,...也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:32.99,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝被带往那里了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一口气冲过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:38.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:41.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞翼冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:41.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:47.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:53.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 你们先走！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:54.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:59.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,它们追上来的话 就会被前后夹击
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:02.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里挡住它们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:03.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:05.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能一个人留在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要救女帝的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:11.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:13.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也留下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是坏习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:22.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,再多依靠我一些 我没说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:26.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 老实说我有心里有底了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.39,0:09:28.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:31.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可是最强的搭档！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:34.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:37.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要乱来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:42.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 你是我的骑士吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:44.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.51,0:09:47.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢在这种地方倒下 我绝饶不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:48.89,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要全身而退！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:51.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,还有蝴蝶你也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:55.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谨遵公主命令
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:09:59.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:02.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,此路不通了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:02.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,此路不通了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:13.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:18.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:30.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:32.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要打过来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.93,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威幕纱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.93,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Majestic Veil
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.25,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,杵着干嘛 快点走！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Ma... Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:52.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:56.93,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么会有变化出天籁石的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.27,0:10:59.86,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会有着这种不可思议的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:04.22,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我们是5个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:08.16,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这么理解的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:12.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大公主孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:15.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,她内心非常孤单吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:19.03,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,她也渴望能够一起战斗的伙伴吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:24.89,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,能够同甘苦 共患难的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:29.86,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 继承了她的使命的Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:32.45,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,才会是我们5个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:36.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,快走！这种程度很轻松就能回敬过去 马上就追上你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:39.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我... 相信伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:43.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:52.22,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,别停下脚步！英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好强大啊 被称作英雄的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.40,0:12:12.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得为什么选择你作为暗塌谷能量的容器 而不是皇帝？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:18.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你也是英雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:22.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你的内心有着被称作英雄的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:28.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,正因为这份光芒 你比皇帝更有器量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:31.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才选择了你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:37.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 更大的容器正在来这里的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:42.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,渴望力量 一心破坏的使用者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:47.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky会成为好容器
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:53.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,变成2个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:58.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 一开始是孤零零的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:02.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有你在我身旁 我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:12.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:13.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:18.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来救你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别过来！这是陷阱...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:24.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:28.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暗黑首领！不会再放任你肆意妄为了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:34.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人的胸中 都有着名为心的宝贵故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:41.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能输给 把这些人称作容器的你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:44.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:44.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:05.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,早料到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:23.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你这种招数对我们已经不起作用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:28.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,没有容器 果然只能达到这种程度...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:30.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在说！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 女帝...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:36.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:37.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这...这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:49.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就如同对诞生自暗塌谷能量之海的人而言 光明是毒一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.15,0:14:53.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,对你们而言 这海就是毒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:57.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这么靠近 又怎么会不受影响
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.66,0:15:03.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是在明知道... 是陷阱的情况下... 依然来到了这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:06.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不会因为这种程度...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:09.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,名不虚传 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:13.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.69,0:15:31.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:36.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,用你的力量 用英雄的力量来制止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:47.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量不足吗？那便渴求吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,如你这般的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:05.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定能将暗塌谷能量控制为自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想救同伴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:26.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:30.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:50.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你渴求了力量呢 这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:02.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,向着容器接近了一步呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:08.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我不会输给这种力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:12.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我要控制住这力量... 变得更强...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:15.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,救... 大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:20.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,太... 精彩了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:31.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:43.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:06.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,最强的力量是无可匹敌的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:12.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:15.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我得到最优秀的容器了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:19.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让世界明白 力量才是一切
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:25.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量才是... 我才是最强的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:26.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:28.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:32.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快...住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:41.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:52.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:18:58.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:01.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！还没有堕落吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:06.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,动手！快动手！你已经是我的东西了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,为...为什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:28.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只要还有着相信自己 等待着自己的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:30.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就能够无数次站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:33.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是英雄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.46,0:19:43.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这... 这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:59.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 Cure Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:02.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了 Cure Prism
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的伤口为什么？光明的力量对我来说...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:11.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,即使诞生的世界不同 你与我们也是相同的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:14.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这能否当作是理由呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相同？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:19.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这段时间的经历 让我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:22.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,敢于挺身面对任何困难
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:27.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,坚信自己正义的英雄的英姿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我走错了路 不配被称作英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:35.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:39.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有优秀到能够被称作英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:44.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,无数次的犯错 迷茫 停下脚步...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:50.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 在这种时候 总有朋友在身边支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:59.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,力量并非一切的话 那应该相信什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:03.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝 这是我们的回答
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:13.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们... 交个朋友吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:28.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好朋友... 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.61,0:21:30.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:34.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我读了好多好多的画书
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.49,0:21:38.32,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,还是最喜欢大团圆结局了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:40.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.40,0:21:47.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,大蛇兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:51.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那啥啊 你的戏份早就没了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:56.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能输给 视体型为力量的对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:22:00.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,让你尝尝5个人的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:01.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:04.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:09.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:09.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,960)}天空愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.58,0:22:12.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家和我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:48.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大蛇兽 怎么可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.89,0:23:50.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,输给你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:52.38,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对没问题的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.61,0:23:54.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.30,0:23:57.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！我们是没有极限的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:24:00.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:24:00.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,无限广阔的！我们的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:33.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:39.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:44.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:52.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:57.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:01:01.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:07.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:12.15,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:14.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:18.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.05,0:01:22.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:26.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:26.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:28.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:28.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:33.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:38.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:43.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.93,0:01:48.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:51.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:59.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.41,0:22:20.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFE9B9&\3c&H9E7055&\4c&HFFE9B9&}亲爱的闪亮天空 向天空念出魔法
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.04,0:22:20.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HA7F6BD&\3c&H479D52&\4c&HA7F6BD&}亲爱的闪亮天空 向天空念出魔法
Dialogue: 2,0:22:18.91,0:22:20.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HBEECFF&\3c&H278AA7&\4c&HA7F6BD&}亲爱的闪亮天空 向天空念出魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:24.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HA7F6BD&\3c&H479D52&\4c&HA7F6BD&)}“明天也要是个好日子”
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.02,0:22:24.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HBEECFF&\3c&H278AA7&\4c&HA7F6BD&}“明天也要是个好日子”
Dialogue: 3,0:22:22.73,0:22:24.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HBDC1FF&\3c&H676ABA&\4c&HBDC1FF&}“明天也要是个好日子”
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.98,0:22:24.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFFC7FF&\3c&HA85CB4&\4c&HFFC7FF&}“明天也要是个好日子”
